01:07:29.260 --> 01:07:30.693
You sure are busy.

01:07:30.700 --> 01:07:32.656
Yes. Surely I am.

01:07:33.580 --> 01:07:36.940
back coffee again? It's bad for your health.

01:07:36.940 --> 01:07:39.818
Water is what you should have
if you can't sleep at night.

01:10:53.860 --> 01:10:54.975
Hi. it's me.

01:10:55.060 --> 01:10:57.940
I'm back to Hong Kong.

01:10:57.940 --> 01:11:01.455
Want me to reserve a seat for you?
call me. It's the same number. Bye.

01:11:49.780 --> 01:11:54.092
What beautiful hair!

01:11:54.579 --> 01:11:55.853
How long have you grown it?

01:11:56.020 --> 01:11:58.250
It's none of your business. Crazy woman.

01:12:00.820 --> 01:12:02.776
Isn't she a bitch?

01:12:03.220 --> 01:12:05.176
Yeah.

01:12:08.020 --> 01:12:09.976
What?

01:12:10.420 --> 01:12:12.650
Nothing...
Well, actually, do you know her very well?

01:12:12.820 --> 01:12:14.776
Not really.

01:12:21.220 --> 01:12:27.348
One day. I suddenly had this feeling
that she had returned.

01:12:55.780 --> 01:12:58.852
I am not sure
if I've forgotten to turn off the tap

01:12:59.140 --> 01:13:01.539
or if the house's been getting
more and more sentimental.

01:13:01.539 --> 01:13:03.894
I've always thought that it's been
the strongest.

01:13:03.940 --> 01:13:06.090
It's been crying a lot.

01:13:06.820 --> 01:13:08.094
When a person cries,

01:13:08.260 --> 01:13:10.615
you can simply give him a piece of tissue paper
to dry his tears.

01:13:10.659 --> 01:13:12.372
But when a house cries,

01:13:12.579 --> 01:13:17.649
you really got a lot of hard works to do.

01:13:33.220 --> 01:13:35.176
Wow! How come you're here?

01:13:36.100 --> 01:13:38.980
- This is my home. of course I'm here.
- Your home?

01:13:38.980 --> 01:13:40.413
What are you doing here?

01:13:40.900 --> 01:13:42.820
I come to buy goldfish.

01:13:42.820 --> 01:13:45.095
- No-one sells goldfish here.
- No?

01:13:45.220 --> 01:13:47.609
- You said you came here to buy goldfish?
- Yes.

01:13:47.619 --> 01:13:49.530
Do you come here to buy or sell goldfish?

01:13:49.539 --> 01:13:51.848
What are you trying to say?

01:13:52.900 --> 01:13:55.778
Don't push me.
I can't remember a thing when I'm scared.

01:13:56.260 --> 01:13:57.699
Why are you scared?

01:13:57.699 --> 01:14:01.089
I don't know! I'm just scared of you.

01:14:01.539 --> 01:14:03.495
I'm going now.

01:14:06.820 --> 01:14:09.095
What is this? You're still standing here.

01:14:10.659 --> 01:14:14.015
Don't rush me!
There's something wrong with my legs.

01:14:14.020 --> 01:14:15.692
Are you having a cramp?

01:14:15.940 --> 01:14:18.090
How do I know? I've never had one before.

01:14:19.300 --> 01:14:21.256
Come in and take a rest.

01:14:30.100 --> 01:14:32.170
Every time she returned from a trip.

01:14:32.260 --> 01:14:34.820
I'll massage her legs.

01:14:34.900 --> 01:14:37.972
Being an air hostess is no easy job.

01:14:38.260 --> 01:14:40.659
I always think. that women 's legs are very sexy.

01:14:40.659 --> 01:14:43.731
I haven 't touched one since she left.

01:14:50.739 --> 01:14:52.252
Feeling better?

01:14:52.659 --> 01:14:53.887
Yes. Can I go now?

01:14:53.980 --> 01:14:55.900
Stay for a while.

01:14:55.900 --> 01:14:57.891
I'II play some music for you.

01:15:19.300 --> 01:15:21.256
Do you like this song?

01:15:21.699 --> 01:15:23.619
I don't care much for music.

01:15:23.619 --> 01:15:25.575
It's my girlfriend's choice.

01:15:28.900 --> 01:15:30.856
You sure she liked this song?

01:15:31.300 --> 01:15:33.256
Yes.

01:15:40.900 --> 01:15:43.733
I know his girlfriend doesn't like this song at all.

01:15:44.739 --> 01:15:47.014
The CD was mine. I left it here a few days ago.

01:15:48.579 --> 01:15:52.891
I was starting to wonder if sleepwalking
could infect to other people.

01:15:52.900 --> 01:15:54.618
Wonder if I've been too nervous.

01:15:54.820 --> 01:15:57.458
After a while I just felt asleep

01:16:19.180 --> 01:16:21.819
The girl fell asleep in my house that afternoon.

01:16:23.020 --> 01:16:25.056
I wanted to wake her up.

01:16:25.420 --> 01:16:27.376
but for some reason I didn't do that...

01:16:59.140 --> 01:17:00.289
Shit!
Shit!

01:17:03.100 --> 01:17:05.011
Watch out with the fire.

01:17:06.460 --> 01:17:09.930
Watch out! Handle the candles with care.

01:17:14.140 --> 01:17:17.371
It's all your fault. What's wrong with you lately?

01:17:17.500 --> 01:17:19.420
Why didn't you pay the electricity's bill?

01:17:19.420 --> 01:17:22.332
Where have you been every day?

01:17:23.260 --> 01:17:25.137
To see the doctor.

01:17:25.180 --> 01:17:27.978
Doctor? I don't see you talking any medicine.

01:17:28.060 --> 01:17:31.291
of course I did. You just didn't notice.

01:17:31.420 --> 01:17:35.333
really? Did the doctor tell you
when you'll recover?

01:17:35.739 --> 01:17:39.129
It won't take long.

01:17:43.420 --> 01:17:44.899
Idiot !

01:17:57.460 --> 01:18:00.340
I wonder if it's the weather or what.

01:18:00.340 --> 01:18:02.808
Lately. I've found that I've changed a lot.

01:18:03.220 --> 01:18:04.659
I've become more observant.

01:18:04.659 --> 01:18:08.095
I start too notice a loot of things
which I never paid attention.

01:18:11.380 --> 01:18:13.610
Even sardines are tasting differently.

01:19:05.860 --> 01:19:08.897
My mother was very pretty in her youth.

01:19:09.220 --> 01:19:11.734
You mustn't give yourself up.

01:19:12.100 --> 01:19:14.773
How can you have grown so fat
in such a short time?

01:19:16.420 --> 01:19:19.776
Even if she's gone,
you still have to carry on with yourself.

01:19:20.739 --> 01:19:23.378
You mustn't indulge yourself any more.
Control your diet.

01:19:24.460 --> 01:19:27.133
Do you know how you've disappointed me?

01:19:27.340 --> 01:19:29.649
You've changed so much.

01:19:29.739 --> 01:19:31.889
one mustn't change one's personality.

01:19:32.140 --> 01:19:35.974
You mustn't change yourself,
even if she's not coming. back any more.

01:19:37.420 --> 01:19:39.376
You really have to reflect on this.

01:19:45.100 --> 01:19:47.773
When I see it cry. I actually feel relieved.

01:19:47.980 --> 01:19:52.451
Despite the change of its look.
it still remains true too itself.

01:19:53.739 --> 01:19:55.377
It is still an emotionally-charged time.

01:19:55.659 --> 01:20:00.449
Haven't you noticed
that I've become more optimistic??

01:20:01.900 --> 01:20:04.300
I've found that many things are looking better.

01:20:04.300 --> 01:20:06.336
You, for example, were a little dumb.

01:20:07.659 --> 01:20:09.968
You mustn't make yourself so dirty though.

01:20:10.060 --> 01:20:12.016
You used to be so much cleaner.

01:20:13.420 --> 01:20:15.980
And look at these yellowish stripes.

01:20:17.739 --> 01:20:19.218
Have you been fighting with others?

01:20:21.100 --> 01:20:23.056
But you look a lot more cute now.

01:20:28.780 --> 01:20:32.056
Why are you hiding here?
I've been looking all over for you.

01:20:35.500 --> 01:20:37.456
It's useless lying here.

01:20:37.900 --> 01:20:39.856
have to accept reality.

01:20:43.659 --> 01:20:46.457
You're starting to smell too.

01:20:46.539 --> 01:20:51.215
Let's go sunbathing tomorrow.

01:21:36.579 --> 01:21:37.534
What are you doing in my house?

01:21:37.659 --> 01:21:39.615
You asked me to visit you sometime.

01:21:43.180 --> 01:21:46.252
Open up.
hurry!

01:22:15.579 --> 01:22:18.377
Someone's looking for you.

01:22:18.460 --> 01:22:20.416
- Me?
- That's right.

01:22:23.619 --> 01:22:26.452
Wow!
Why are you here?

01:22:26.500 --> 01:22:27.535
I've come for my letter.

01:22:28.539 --> 01:22:30.575
What letter.? Ask the chief

01:22:32.140 --> 01:22:33.414
You've been keeping it.

01:22:33.579 --> 01:22:37.094
- He says it's with you.
- Me? Where?

01:22:39.100 --> 01:22:40.931
really?

01:22:41.020 --> 01:22:42.976
oh, yes.

01:22:45.820 --> 01:22:49.130
I'm just afraid that it'll be lost.
I swear I haven't read it.

01:22:53.260 --> 01:22:55.216
Thanks.

01:22:56.619 --> 01:22:58.539
Will you be free tomorrow evening?

01:22:58.539 --> 01:23:00.928
Why? What do you want?

01:23:01.180 --> 01:23:02.408
I want to take you for a date.

01:23:02.500 --> 01:23:06.192
- Why do you want to date me?
- The manager said you'll be off tomorrow.

01:23:07.539 --> 01:23:10.595
Why should I need a date for a day off?

01:23:10.900 --> 01:23:12.711
You think about it.

01:23:12.820 --> 01:23:16.813
I'II wait for you at the California Restaurant
tomorrow night at 88.

01:23:18.940 --> 01:23:21.659
This song doesn't suit you.

01:23:21.820 --> 01:23:23.776
Listen to this.

01:23:36.340 --> 01:23:38.296
Shit !
Oh shit !

01:23:45.460 --> 01:23:47.928
Didn't know #633 was so good with girls.

01:23:48.340 --> 01:23:51.010
- It's #633, Chief!
- Get out of here...

01:23:59.500 --> 01:24:01.377
hold... hold on a second. I haven't got...

01:24:01.420 --> 01:24:03.331
Chili sauce. Here, here. OK?

01:24:03.820 --> 01:24:05.139
Coke, please.

01:24:05.380 --> 01:24:07.336
What?

01:24:07.780 --> 01:24:09.736
Coke, please.

01:24:11.140 --> 01:24:13.096
Coke.. the paper cup ran out...

01:24:13.539 --> 01:24:16.736
- Mutton.
- Mutton? Ha!

01:24:21.579 --> 01:24:23.888
I cleaned up the house that afternoon.

01:24:23.980 --> 01:24:28.658
It's like clearing up the runway
for the next flight.

01:25:04.780 --> 01:25:07.294
I arrived at the California a little earlier
that evening.

01:25:07.659 --> 01:25:10.412
Since I didn 't know how long the flight
will be delayed.

01:25:10.539 --> 01:25:12.495
I decided too get some loose change.

01:25:24.940 --> 01:25:26.293
Somme loose change, please.

01:25:44.380 --> 01:25:47.053
Half an hour later.
I got some more loose change.

01:25:47.260 --> 01:25:50.411
I had a feeling that the flight might have been
canceled.

01:26:13.659 --> 01:26:15.536
She won't be coming.

01:26:15.579 --> 01:26:17.535
She asked me to give you this letter.

01:26:20.860 --> 01:26:22.816
No need to be sad though.

01:26:23.260 --> 01:26:25.216
Try another one.

01:26:26.140 --> 01:26:29.815
May is a good girl. She'll be coming. back to work
tomorrow. Try her.

01:26:29.980 --> 01:26:31.420
Where is she?

01:26:31.420 --> 01:26:35.095
She's quit. She said she's going to California.

01:26:36.220 --> 01:26:38.176
That's all.

01:26:38.619 --> 01:26:40.575
Thanks.

01:26:43.420 --> 01:26:45.376
I didn't open the letter.

01:26:46.300 --> 01:26:48.768
There are things that you need time too accept.

01:26:49.060 --> 01:26:51.340
After the manager left.

01:26:51.340 --> 01:26:53.410
I started talking too the beer bottles.

01:26:54.699 --> 01:26:56.655
Disappointed?

01:26:56.980 --> 01:26:58.538
Not really.

01:26:58.900 --> 01:27:02.131
Go home and sleep. She 's not coming.

01:27:13.780 --> 01:27:16.055
She did indeed go too California that evening.

01:27:16.180 --> 01:27:17.860
It's just that it's the other California.

01:27:17.860 --> 01:27:20.499
That same evening.
we were at two different California's.

01:27:20.500 --> 01:27:22.855
separated by a time difference of 1 5 hours.

01:27:24.460 --> 01:27:26.690
It should be 1 1 am now in California. USA.

01:27:29.260 --> 01:27:32.696
I wonder if she will remember
that I have a date with her at 8pm.

01:27:48.579 --> 01:27:50.535
What a coincidence!

01:27:52.900 --> 01:27:54.572
You're off tonight?

01:27:54.820 --> 01:27:56.776
Yes.

01:27:58.659 --> 01:28:00.100
How are you?

01:28:00.100 --> 01:28:01.931
Still the same. And you?

01:28:02.020 --> 01:28:03.976
Not bad.

01:28:04.420 --> 01:28:06.340
You alone?

01:28:06.340 --> 01:28:07.978
I'm with a friend.

01:28:11.860 --> 01:28:13.659
Good match.

01:28:13.659 --> 01:28:17.937
You still have some stuff at my place.
When will you pick them up?

01:28:17.980 --> 01:28:23.008
Don't want them any more. Throw them away.

01:28:24.220 --> 01:28:26.176
OK

01:28:29.500 --> 01:28:30.853
Got to go now.

01:28:33.100 --> 01:28:37.537
- I still think you look better in your uniform.
- You too.

01:28:37.900 --> 01:28:39.572
- Bye.
- Bye.

01:28:41.860 --> 01:28:44.499
- You haven't paid.
- You pay for me.

01:29:14.140 --> 01:29:16.096
How much, please?

01:30:53.980 --> 01:30:56.335
The letter turned out to be a boarding pass.

01:30:56.380 --> 01:30:58.336
The date. however. was a year later.

01:30:59.260 --> 01:31:02.049
I missed the destination
it was blur.

01:31:14.500 --> 01:31:17.260
I did go to the restaurant that night.

01:31:17.260 --> 01:31:20.093
I knew it would be crowded by 8.
So I arrived at 7: 1 5.

01:31:21.100 --> 01:31:22.499
It was pouring that evening.

01:31:22.539 --> 01:31:26.612
Thorough the window. I saw a raining California.

01:31:26.860 --> 01:31:32.140
I wanted too know desperately if the other
California is warm and sunny.

01:31:32.140 --> 01:31:34.370
I decided to give myself one year's time.

01:31:35.380 --> 01:31:39.168
Today. the rain is just as heavy as that day.

01:31:39.699 --> 01:31:42.850
Looking out of the window.
I only have one person in mind.

01:31:44.500 --> 01:31:46.730
I wonder if he had ever opened the letter.

01:32:42.340 --> 01:32:43.898
Why are you here?

01:32:48.220 --> 01:32:52.900
- Why are you here?
- How come it's you?

01:32:52.900 --> 01:32:55.778
What are you doing here?

01:32:55.900 --> 01:32:57.174
Refurbishing.

01:32:57.220 --> 01:32:59.176
Refurbishing ?

01:33:00.579 --> 01:33:01.539
Where's my cousin?

01:33:01.539 --> 01:33:04.292
He's opened a karaoke.

01:33:06.340 --> 01:33:07.932
He said he wanted a change.

01:33:08.260 --> 01:33:10.012
and let me take over.

01:33:10.180 --> 01:33:12.011
Didn't he tell you?

01:33:12.100 --> 01:33:14.978
I haven't seen him.

01:33:14.980 --> 01:33:18.131
He's really got a business sense.

01:33:18.340 --> 01:33:22.300
First he sold me the fish and chips,
and then the whole shop.

01:33:22.300 --> 01:33:23.699
What?

01:33:24.220 --> 01:33:26.256
I said he's got a great business mind.

01:33:32.619 --> 01:33:35.179
Since when are you into this kind of loud music??

01:33:36.820 --> 01:33:39.857
It takes a little time to get used to
and then it's fine.

01:33:40.659 --> 01:33:42.377
Did you go to California?

01:33:42.460 --> 01:33:43.813
- Was it fun?
- What?

01:33:52.659 --> 01:33:56.368
Did you go to California? Was it fun?

01:33:56.500 --> 01:34:00.891
California? Just the same. No big deal.

01:34:07.300 --> 01:34:08.813
You look pretty good in uniform.

01:34:11.260 --> 01:34:13.171
You look nice in this too.

01:34:13.180 --> 01:34:15.091
Want to eat something?

01:34:15.579 --> 01:34:17.020
Guess not.

01:34:17.020 --> 01:34:20.171
I have an early flight tomorrow.

01:34:22.780 --> 01:34:26.932
When will you be back?
I'm opening this in two days' time.

01:34:29.500 --> 01:34:32.936
I don't know. This time it may take a while.

01:34:37.180 --> 01:34:39.648
Well, write me a letter.
when you reach someplace.

01:34:43.180 --> 01:34:44.740
You may not even read it.

01:34:44.740 --> 01:34:47.777
Just want to ask you something.

01:34:59.140 --> 01:35:02.371
Will you let a person board
with a boarding pass like this?

01:35:08.260 --> 01:35:10.979
The date is today,

01:35:11.140 --> 01:35:13.813
but the rain blurred it.

01:35:14.020 --> 01:35:17.729
I don't know where it's going to. Do you know?

01:35:18.340 --> 01:35:20.695
I've no idea.

01:35:21.700 --> 01:35:23.656
Let me give you another one.

01:35:26.980 --> 01:35:28.936
Great.

01:35:38.860 --> 01:35:40.498
Where do you want to go?

01:35:41.980 --> 01:35:44.972
Wherever you want to take me to...

